Package: acer-sense
Source: linuwu-sense
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Antonio Orizondo Leyva <aorizondoleyva@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 117
Depends: python3:any, python3-pyqt6, acer-powersave (= 1.0.0)
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/aorizondo/Div-Linuwu-Sense
Description: graphical control panel for Acer Predator and Nitro laptops
 A PredatorSense-like interface built on the linuwu_sense driver and on
 power-profiles-daemon. It needs acer-powersave, which provides the hardware
 layer and the kernel driver.
 .
 Includes:
  * live monitoring of temperatures, fan speed, power draw and CPU state;
  * fan control: automatic, manual, or an editable curve where you set the
    temperature at which the fans start and how steeply they ramp up;
  * keyboard backlight: effects, speed, direction, brightness, and a fixed
    colour per zone on four-zone keyboards;
  * power profiles, panel refresh rate, and hot plug of the NVIDIA GPU;
  * battery charge limit, calibration and firmware settings.
 .
 It opens with the laptop's dedicated key (PredatorSense on Predator models,
 the N key on Nitro), which this package sets up for you.
